# Bugbot workflow (mdeapp)

Use [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/docs/bugbot) before opening or updating CK-V2 PRs.

## Local review (agent)

When the user says `review`, `/review-bugbot`, or before `gh pr create`:

1. Launch the **bugbot** subagent (`readonly: true`) with:
   - `Full Repository Path: /home/sk/mdeai/mdeapp`
   - `Diff: branch changes` (or `uncommitted changes` if asked)
   - `Base Branch:` only when not comparing to `main`
2. Summarize findings in a Severity | Location | Finding table.
3. **Do not auto-fix** unless the user asks.

Running `/review-bugbot` locally syncs with GitHub Bugbot via patch ID — same diff may skip duplicate remote review.

## GitHub review (manual)

On an open PR, comment:

```text
cursor review
```

or `bugbot run`. Verbose: `cursor review verbose=true`.

## Project rules file

Bugbot reads `.cursor/BUGBOT.md` (root) plus nested `.cursor/BUGBOT.md` when reviewing files in those trees. Keep mdeai hard rules there, not duplicated in every PR.

## Teach Bugbot inline

On a PR comment: `@cursor remember [fact]` — saved as a learned rule for future reviews.

## CI check

GitHub check name: `Cursor Bugbot`. Default findings are `neutral`; enable fail-on-unresolved in dashboard if merges must block on bugs.

## mdeapp habits

- One PR closes one `SAN-NNN` only.
- CK-V2 guardrail PRs: run `npm run audit:copilotkit-v2:depcruise` before push.
- Do not bundle unrelated dirty worktree files (see `LESSONS.md` §0).
